{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-organogram0001",
    "name": "univ-v2-organogram",
    "description": "Organogram (org) APIs — positions on `department_structure` + heads (`user_id`).\n\n## Flow\n1. `POST /departmentStructure/` — create structure (`subAccountId` + `parentAccountId` optional/null for root)\n2. `GET /org/cards` — KPI summary\n3. `POST /org/` — create position (can be vacant)\n4. `POST /org/head` — assign user as PRIMARY/ACTING\n5. List / update / markVacant / delete as needed\n\nSet `baseurl` + `token`. Permissions reuse DEPARTMENT_* .\n\nSee also: `docs/ORGANOGRAM_NAMING_CONVENTION.md` and `docs/postman/ORGANOGRAM_POSTMAN.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "org positions",
      "description": "CRUD for `org_position` under a `departmentStructureId`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "summary cards",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/cards",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "cards"]
            },
            "description": "**GET /org/cards**\n\nNo query/body keys.\n\nReturns:\n- `totalPositions` `{ count, changePercent }`\n- `filledPositions` `{ count, changePercent }`\n- `vacantPositions` `{ count, changePercent }`\n- `departments` `{ count, changePercent }` (`changePercent` always `null`)\n- `reportingLevels` `{ count, changePercent }` (`changePercent` always `null`)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "create position",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const row = res.orgPosition;",
                  "  if (row && row.orgPositionId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orgPositionId', String(row.orgPositionId));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"departmentStructureId\": {{departmentStructureId}},\n  \"subAccountId\": {{subAccountId}},\n  \"positionName\": \"Head of Department\",\n  \"positionCode\": \"HOD-CSE\",\n  \"employmentCategory\": \"Academic\",\n  \"reportsToOrgPositionId\": null,\n  \"reportingType\": \"Direct\",\n  \"isVacant\": true,\n  \"sortOrder\": 1,\n  \"level\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", ""]
            },
            "description": "**POST /org/**\n\n**Required**\n- `departmentStructureId` (int)\n- `positionName` (string)\n- `employmentCategory` — `Academic` | `Administrative` | `Support` | `Executive` | `Leadership`\n- `level` (int ≥ 1)\n\n**Optional**\n- `subAccountId` (int | null) — department this position belongs to (e.g. HOD of CSE)\n- `positionCode` (string | null)\n- `reportsToOrgPositionId` (int | null) — null for top positions\n- `reportingType` (string | null)\n- `isVacant` (boolean) — default `true`\n- `sortOrder` (int) — default `0`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "list positions",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/?departmentStructureId={{departmentStructureId}}&subAccountId={{subAccountId}}&employmentCategory=Academic&isVacant=true",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", ""],
              "query": [
                { "key": "departmentStructureId", "value": "{{departmentStructureId}}", "description": "optional filter" },
                { "key": "subAccountId", "value": "{{subAccountId}}", "description": "optional filter — department" },
                { "key": "employmentCategory", "value": "Academic", "description": "optional filter" },
                { "key": "isVacant", "value": "true", "description": "optional filter — true|false" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**GET /org/**\n\n**Required**\n- none\n\n**Optional query**\n- `departmentStructureId` (int)\n- `subAccountId` (int)\n- `employmentCategory` — `Academic` | `Administrative` | `Support` | `Executive` | `Leadership`\n- `isVacant` — `true` | `false`\n\nIncludes structure, subAccount, reportsTo, and heads."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "get single position",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/single?orgPositionId={{orgPositionId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "single"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "orgPositionId", "value": "{{orgPositionId}}", "description": "required" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**GET /org/single**\n\n**Required query**\n- `orgPositionId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- none"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "update position",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orgPositionId\": {{orgPositionId}},\n  \"subAccountId\": {{subAccountId}},\n  \"positionName\": \"Head of Department\",\n  \"positionCode\": \"HOD-CSE\",\n  \"employmentCategory\": \"Academic\",\n  \"reportingType\": \"Direct\",\n  \"sortOrder\": 1,\n  \"level\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", ""]
            },
            "description": "**PATCH /org/**\n\n**Required**\n- `orgPositionId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- `departmentStructureId` (int)\n- `subAccountId` (int | null)\n- `positionName` (string)\n- `positionCode` (string | null)\n- `employmentCategory` — `Academic` | `Administrative` | `Support` | `Executive` | `Leadership`\n- `reportsToOrgPositionId` (int | null)\n- `reportingType` (string | null)\n- `sortOrder` (int)\n- `level` (int ≥ 1)\n\nDo **not** send `isVacant` here — use `POST /org/markVacant` or head flows."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "mark position vacant",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orgPositionId\": {{orgPositionId}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/markVacant",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "markVacant"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /org/markVacant**\n\n**Required**\n- `orgPositionId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- none\n\nSets ACTIVE heads to INACTIVE and `isVacant = true`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "delete position",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/?orgPositionId={{orgPositionId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", ""],
              "query": [
                { "key": "orgPositionId", "value": "{{orgPositionId}}", "description": "required" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**DELETE /org/**\n\n**Required query**\n- `orgPositionId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- none\n\nSoft-deletes position and its heads."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "org heads",
      "description": "Assign users to an `org_position` (`org_position_head`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "add head",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const row = res.head;",
                  "  if (row && row.orgPositionHeadId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orgPositionHeadId', String(row.orgPositionHeadId));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orgPositionId\": {{orgPositionId}},\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"holderType\": \"PRIMARY\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"joiningDate\": \"2022-06-15\",\n  \"endDate\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/head",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "head"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /org/head**\n\n**Required**\n- `orgPositionId` (int)\n- `userId` (int)\n- `holderType` — `PRIMARY` | `ACTING`\n\n**Optional**\n- `status` — `ACTIVE` | `INACTIVE` (default `ACTIVE`)\n- `joiningDate` (YYYY-MM-DD | null)\n- `endDate` (YYYY-MM-DD | null)\n\nDefault `ACTIVE` → sets position `isVacant = false`. Rejects duplicate ACTIVE (position, user)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "list heads",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/head?orgPositionId={{orgPositionId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "head"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "orgPositionId", "value": "{{orgPositionId}}", "description": "required" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**GET /org/head**\n\n**Required query**\n- `orgPositionId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- none"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "update head",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orgPositionHeadId\": {{orgPositionHeadId}},\n  \"holderType\": \"ACTING\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"joiningDate\": \"2022-06-15\",\n  \"endDate\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/head",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "head"]
            },
            "description": "**PATCH /org/head**\n\n**Required**\n- `orgPositionHeadId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- `holderType` — `PRIMARY` | `ACTING`\n- `status` — `ACTIVE` | `INACTIVE`\n- `joiningDate` (YYYY-MM-DD | null)\n- `endDate` (YYYY-MM-DD | null)\n\nRecalculates parent `isVacant` after status change."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "delete head",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/org/head?orgPositionHeadId={{orgPositionHeadId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["org", "head"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "orgPositionHeadId", "value": "{{orgPositionHeadId}}", "description": "required" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**DELETE /org/head**\n\n**Required query**\n- `orgPositionHeadId` (int)\n\n**Optional**\n- none\n\nSoft-delete. If no ACTIVE heads remain → `isVacant = true`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
